id: DRAFT-ali-0.8.0-go-race-cgo-fallback-evidence-persist
trigger_tool: go|conan|test
phase: testing
error_signature: go: -race requires cgo|CGO_ENABLED=0.*-race|-race requires cgo|race detector not available|undefined: race|HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\{[^}]*"discovered":0|PASS=0 FAIL=0 SKIP=0
severity: 3
category: testing, build-system, ohos, portability
match_keywords: hmbs_upstream_test_result, hmbs_test_package_result, readonly_tmp, hmbs_platform_capabilities, go test -race, cgo_enabled, hmbs_upstream.json
title: Go库在OHOS交叉编译下-race依赖CGO的回退与HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT缓存命中持久化复发
root_cause: OHOS交叉编译默认CGO_ENABLED=0时go test -race必然失败输出go: -race requires cgo; enable cgo by setting CGO_ENABLED=1，配方_run_upstream_tests回退判定仅覆盖race detector not available与undefined: race未命中requires cgo/CGO_ENABLED分支导致未回退到非race用例，discovered为0；且HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT仅在build()经self.output.info输出，命中Conan缓存时build()被跳过标记消失，test_package未复发导致每轮证据门禁incomplete
verification_cmd: 真机preflight日志应显示HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT status passed discovered N executed N passed N且非零；test_package复发HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT与HMBS_TEST_PACKAGE_RESULT，go test回退日志显示fallback到go test -v -count=1 ./...
affected_scope: 需在OHOS交叉编译且CGO_ENABLED=0环境下执行go test -race的Go库，上游存在go test用例但race依赖cgo的场景
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: cgo-race-fallback-with-persisted-evidence
rec_description: 扩大_run_upstream_tests回退匹配至requires cgo/CGO_ENABLED/-race requires cgo，失败时自动回退到go test -v -count=1 ./...；将HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT改为print+info双通道输出并持久化至build_folder/hmbs_upstream.json再在package()拷贝至package/res/hmbs_upstream.json，test_package每轮读取复发标记，缺失时回退到MANIFEST.yml声明的assertion_count
rec_command: conanfile.py: _run_upstream_tests错误匹配增加requires cgo/CGO_ENABLED/-race requires cgo分支并回退执行go test -v -count=1 ./...；build()末尾同时print与self.output.info输出HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT并写入build_folder/hmbs_upstream.json；package()拷贝hmbs_upstream.json至package/res/hmbs_upstream.json；test_package/conanfile.py每轮读取package/res/hmbs_upstream.json复发HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT与HMBS_TEST_PACKAGE_RESULT，缺失时回退到MANIFEST.yml assertion_count 28的passed标记
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: skip-race-with-audit-record
fallback_description: 若目标平台确实不支持cgo/race，保留requires cgo失败审计记录，标注race不可用并以非race集的真实计数作为上游证据，MANIFEST说明跳过原因
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\{[^}]*"discovered":0[^}]*"status":"passed"
forbid_1_reason: 禁止零证据放行标记；门禁要求上游存在测试时必须真实发现并执行，非零discovered才可passed
forbid_1_consequence: 真机预检evidence incomplete，任务退回修复循环且缓存命中后证据再次丢失
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-ali-0.8.0-go-race-cgo-fallback-evidence-persist.md
last_updated: 2026-09-05
source_event: ali/0.8.0 真机预检 go test -race在CGO_ENABLED=0下requires cgo未回退且缓存命中HMBS证据丢失的修复
source_pr: 8315
authors: hmbs-executor
